{"script":"yd_009_08","des":"可可娜-自由之舞","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"trans":true,"img":"chara009_1","layer":"chara2","bright":1,"noIn":false,"x":330,"mirrow":false,"y":-126,"addImg":"chara009_1_face_chara009_1a","scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"img":"chara009_1","transTime":300,"layer":"chara2","bright":1,"noIn":false,"x":330,"mirrow":false,"y":-126,"addImg":"chara009_1_face_chara009_1a","scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"可可娜","text":"[show]可可娜虽然不喜欢繁杂的训练……也不喜欢那些欺负可可娜的舞团成员……但可可娜确实对跳舞感兴趣。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara009_1_face_chara009_1b","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"可可娜","text":"[show]每次跳舞的时候，可可娜都能感觉到身上的压力被释放了许多。[r]或许是只有舞动身姿的时候，可可娜才能感受到片刻的自由。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"可可娜","text":"[show]我在舞台上跳舞的时候……就有这种感觉……好像也只有在台上会有这种感觉。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"可可娜","text":"[show]可可娜不记得自己在舞台上的具体表现了，但每次表演结束后，拉碧丝和夏库塔拉都夸赞可可娜跳得好。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara009_1_face_chara009_1d","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"可可娜","text":"[show]可可娜……是不会被这些夸奖欺骗的……他们夸奖可可娜只是想骗取信任而已，但可可娜只信任自己！[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"trans":true,"img":"chara009_1","transTime":300,"layer":"chara2","bright":1,"noIn":false,"x":330,"mirrow":false,"y":-126,"addImg":"chara009_1_face_chara009_1d","scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}